IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SHADOWKV-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 HEAD-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SVD-RANK            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 REDUCTION-PCT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SHADOWKV-V2.
    IF HEAD-DIM == 0 OR SEQ-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE HEAD-DIM TO SVD-RANK.
    DIVIDE 4 INTO SVD-RANK.
    MOVE 75 TO REDUCTION-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SVD-RANK.
    WEIGHT 30 REDUCTION-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
